    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100370" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεράω</span></b>  (A), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pour together, gather together</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλὰ συνεράσας ᾠὰ εἰς κύστιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>GA</u>
					752a4
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνερᾶν καὶ συμφέρειν</span>, to
			explain <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔρανος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				8.362e
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνερασαι</span> (sine accentu) is 
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκεράσαι</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				5.138
			</span></i>.</div>
